10	 * When the create request carries an email, requires it to be a syntactically valid address and
11	 * stores it lower-cased, mutating the published {@link OwnerFieldsDto} in place so {@link BuildOwner}
12	 * maps the normalised value. A missing email is left untouched; an invalid one is rejected with 400.
